# Ignore everything except ourselves and a few files
/*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.gitmodules
!README.md
!LICENSE
!Logo.png

# Don't ignore project files
!Previews/
!Previews/*
!Mod/
!Mod/*
!Utilities/
!Utilities/*

# Ignore experimental content
Utilities/Datamine/Experimental

# Ignore data files
Utilities/RuntimeExtract
Utilities/Datamine/GameDirectory
Utilities/Datamine/WallTools/data
Utilities/Datamine/WallTools/InvisWalls_*
Utilities/Datamine/ZoneTools/data/
Utilities/Datamine/ZoneTools/exports/
Utilities/Datamine/ZoneTools/**/__pycache__/

# Ignore blend files used to reconstruct volume datasets
*.blend
